# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
.idea
.vscode

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work

# Local tool downloads / scratch
.tmp/

# Local configuration and secrets (track only explicit *.example files)
internal/resources/properties.yml
.env*
!.env.example
!internal/resources/properties.example.yml

# Credential / key material artifacts
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_rsa.pub
credentials.json
secrets.json

# Archify visual-check sidecars and delivery scratch (regenerate locally)
docs/diagrams/*.visual-check.*
docs/diagrams/.archify-delivery-*/
